### User longer than 20 characters -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/disbursement-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "orderTrackingCode": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
  "affiliateStoreId": "9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d",
  "scheduledFrom": "2026-12-01",
  "scheduledTo": "2026-12-10",
  "transferCapAmount": 10,
  "transferCapCurrencyCode": "PEN",
  "user": "operator-with-a-very-long-name"
}

### Remarks longer than 85 characters -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/disbursement-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "orderTrackingCode": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
  "affiliateStoreId": "9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d",
  "scheduledFrom": "2026-12-01",
  "scheduledTo": "2026-12-10",
  "transferCapAmount": 10,
  "transferCapCurrencyCode": "PEN",
  "user": "operator01",
  "remarks": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
}

### Invalid order tracking code (not a GUID) -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/disbursement-orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: es-PE

{
  "orderTrackingCode": "not-a-guid",
  "affiliateStoreId": "9a8b7c6d-5e4f-4a3b-8c2d-1e0f9a8b7c6d",
  "scheduledFrom": "2026-12-01",
  "scheduledTo": "2026-12-10",
  "transferCapAmount": 10,
  "transferCapCurrencyCode": "PEN",
  "user": "operator01"
}
